            "startTime": "01:10",
            "endTime": "01:30",
            "duration": 20.0,
            "spokenAnchor": "\u201cI remember my mom buying plantain, cutting it, and drying it on top of the car in Ikotun... because cassava was called unhealthy.\u201d",
